===

title: MrWilson_Day1
tags:
---
Mr Wilson: Good afternoon students! I want to give you all a warm welcome to where we'll be spending the rest of our week together.
Mr Wilson: We'll be leaving on Friday, so I hope you can make the most of the natural scenery while we're here.
Mr Wilson: You are encouraged to explore, however, for your own safety the forest has been made out of bounds. You are not to enter.
Mr Wilson: On a lighter note, we'll hold a campfire each night to sing and tell stories before you are all to return to your tents for the night.
===
